      ],
      "description": "The intervention is described as reducing Mo by 10–20 at.%, which ordinarily denotes an absolute decrease from 20 at.% Mo to 10–0 at.% Mo, whereas the experiment uses 90% and 80% of the original Mo content, corresponding to only 18 and 16 at.% Mo. These are substantially different substitution ranges."
    },
